# 1. Introduction

HoloJARVIS is designed as a distributed AI system rather than a standalone Raspberry Pi device.

The network architecture enables HoloJARVIS to communicate with multiple computers, mobile devices, web dashboards, and cloud AI services while maintaining secure and reliable connections.

The architecture supports both local (LAN) and remote (Internet) operation.

