# 4. Network Components

## Raspberry Pi Server

Acts as the central controller.

Responsibilities:

- API Server
- AI Processing
- Device Management
- Task Scheduling
- Authentication
- Command Distribution

---

## Desktop Client

Allows users to:

- Chat with HoloJARVIS
- Execute commands
- Monitor connected computers
- Upload files
- Receive notifications

---

## Mobile Application

Provides remote access.

Functions:

- Voice Commands
- Live Status
- Push Notifications
- Remote Automation
- Camera View (future)
- Device Monitoring

---

## Web Dashboard

Browser-based management interface.

Features:

- AI Chat
- System Monitoring
- Computer Management
- File Browser
- Plugin Management
- Settings

---

## Connected Computers

Each connected computer runs a lightweight HoloJARVIS Agent.

The agent is responsible for:

- Receiving commands
- Executing approved tasks
- Returning status updates
- Reporting system information

