# 6. Local Network Architecture

When devices are on the same LAN:

```
Wi-Fi Router

        │

────────┼───────────────

        │

 Raspberry Pi

        │

────────┼───────────────

 Office PC

 Gaming PC

 Laptop

 NAS

 Server
```

Advantages:

- Low latency
- High bandwidth
- No Internet dependency for local control
- Faster file transfers

---

# 7. Remote Access Architecture

When the user is outside the local network:

```
User

↓

Internet

↓

Secure HTTPS

↓

Router

↓

Raspberry Pi

↓

Connected Computers
```

Example:

Office

↓

Home Raspberry Pi

↓

Home Computer

The user can securely issue commands from anywhere.

